1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
¡Marchemos, fillos da patria,

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
O día da gloria xa chegou!

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Contra nós temos a tiranía,

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:20,000
