8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,000
A degollar os nosos fillos e compañeiras!

9
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:42,000
¡Ás armas, cidadáns!

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
¡Formade os vosos batallóns!

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Marchade, marchade,

12
